1
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:38,280
Big Rabbit said to Little Rabbit,

2
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,560
"It's time for bed."

3
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,840
Little Rabbit pulled up the covers

4
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,200
and said to Big Rabbit,

5
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,680
"I miss you."

6
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,760
"Aren't I right here beside you?"

7
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:58,040
Big Rabbit said.

8
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,079
"But I still miss you."

9
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,879
Little Rabbit closed his eyes

10
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:06,040
and said,

11
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,680
"Big Rabbit,

12
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:10,159
every time I have a dream,

13
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,560
I think of you all over again.

14
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,319
So,

15
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:20,719
every dream

16
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,719
is so warm.

17
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:26,479
Even if monsters appear in my dreams,

18
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:28,800
I won't be afraid."

19
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,560
Big Rabbit

20
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:35,080
gently kissed Little Rabbit's forehead.

21
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:38,360
"Every day, every hour,

22
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:40,479
every minute, every second,

23
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,719
I am always thinking of you."

24
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:56,280
Quietly missing you.

25
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:00,120
Uncle Liao,

26
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,120
I miss Mom.

27
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,479
Mom misses Naonao, too.

28
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,199
Uncle Liao,

29
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:20,039
Do you miss Mom, too?

30
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,159
I do.

31
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,599
I'm hungry.

32
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,039
I need something to eat.

33
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:02,080
When is the boat you called getting here?

34
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,039
I already told you.

35
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:03,879
Wait a few days.

36
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:05,599
We have no water, no food.

37
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:06,680
Wait a few more days?

38
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,120
We won't even make it past tomorrow.

39
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:16,800
I know.

40
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,360
But we can't show our faces right now.

41
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,079
I can go buy some.

42
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,160
You can come with me if you're worried.

43
00:04:40,519 --> 00:04:41,079
I'll go buy it.

44
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:42,000
You stay here.

45
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,000
Ma'am,

46
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,959
We're here to take you home.

47
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:55,800
No, I'm a bit scared.

48
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:57,199
Just take it off, it's fine.

49
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:58,079
Let me ask my mom.

50
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,040
Mom!

51
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,120
What is it?

52
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,079
I'm busy right now.

53
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,439
It's not me. It's Jiani.

54
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,839
Shouldn't the gauze on her head come off now?

55
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:07,439
How should I do it?

56
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,240
Jiani?

57
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,759
Let me take a look.

58
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,120
Hello, Auntie.

59
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,360
Oh, Jiani.

60
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,720
I'm taking it off. Let me peel it back.

61
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,519
Look, can you see it?

62
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:26,160
It's healing quite well.

63
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,480
Just take it right off.

64
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,519
Just take it off?

65
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,360
Take it off.

66
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:36,840
Mom...

67
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,000
Wait, why is the scar so big?

68
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,039
You have to give me a refund!

69
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,080
No way.

70
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,559
Let me take a look.

71
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,279
Look at her yourself.

72
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,879
Jiani, do me a favor.

73
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,679
Help me rip this kid's mouth apart.

74
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:55,440
Thanks, Mom.

75
00:08:56,039 --> 00:08:56,639
Give me a kiss.

76
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,919
How does it look?

77
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,399
See for yourself.

78
00:09:07,559 --> 00:09:07,960
This...

79
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:09,200
It's amazing.

80
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:09,840
Amazing, right?

81
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,720
I told you my mom is awesome.

82
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:15,240
Please say thanks to Auntie for me.

83
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,360
You thank my mom, but not me?

84
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:16,919
Thanks.

85
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:17,720
Thank you.

86
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,440
Thank you.

87
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,440
Hello, please show your ID card.

88
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,519
Lao Na

89
00:09:54,039 --> 00:09:54,879
Okay, I got it.

90
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:02,519
Commissar Tan.

91
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:06,159
Any new updates from the Task Force?

92
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:11,440
Yes.

93
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:14,320
Our Chief Ji joined the Task Force.

94
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,639
Chief Ji joined the Task Force?

95
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,120
Who covered the surveillance blind spot at Dongda Bridge?

96
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,159
Brother Zhi took a team there.

97
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,480
What about the shops around New No. 2 Primary School?

98
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:35,720
We checked them yesterday too.

99
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:36,919
The Public Order Division helped out.

100
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:39,120
Chief Ji.

101
00:10:40,519 --> 00:10:41,519
Now that you've joined the Task Force,

102
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:42,879
will you still come back to the police station?

103
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,240
I'm on the Task Force,

104
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,080
but I'm still at the police station.

105
00:10:46,879 --> 00:10:48,080
Canvassing is currently

106
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,399
the main focus of the Task Force.

107
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:01,519
Hello.

108
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:03,039
How can I help you?

109
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,279
I... I want to file a report.

110
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:05,240
What kind of report?

111
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:07,639
A missing person, I guess.

112
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,000
I... I'm not really sure either.

113
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,080
Missing person?

114
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:12,440
What's the situation?

115
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,840
My eldest daughter...

116
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,159
ran away from home.

117
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,440
For what reason?

118
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:22,080
She's... my daughter with my ex-wife.

119
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,440
And with my current wife, well...

120
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:25,960
they've never really gotten along.

121
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:27,919
A while ago,

122
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,559
she ran off after they had an argument.

123
00:11:31,559 --> 00:11:32,399
What's her name?

124
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,960
Li Jianan.

125
00:11:34,559 --> 00:11:35,240
How old is she?

126
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:36,840
Eighteen.

127
00:11:38,279 --> 00:11:39,320
She just turned eighteen this year.

128
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,879
Eighteen.

129
00:11:41,159 --> 00:11:42,080
She's already an adult.

130
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,600
Could she just be throwing a tantrum

131
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,799
and avoiding you on purpose?

132
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,639
Even if she's throwing a tantrum,

133
00:11:46,639 --> 00:11:48,720
her phone shouldn't be off all the time.

134
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:51,039
Jianan is the kind of kid

135
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,799
who keeps everything bottled up inside.

136
00:11:53,279 --> 00:11:55,480
She'd rather talk to strangers or write in her diary

137
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,080
than say a single word to us.

138
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,960
This... this is her diary.

139
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:03,759
Take a look.

140
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,480
Hello, honey.

141
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:29,879
Which gate?

142
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:39,639
It's raining out.

143
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:41,559
You even made a special trip to bring me food.

144
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:42,679
Since it's raining,

145
00:12:43,639 --> 00:12:44,159
eat it while it's hot.

146
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:45,000
Here, take it.

147
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:46,399
I actually...

148
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,840
...have other business here too.

149
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:48,720
Like what?

150
00:12:48,919 --> 00:12:50,840
Our station took a missing person case.

151
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,559
The missing kid knows Bai Jiani.

152
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,639
I wanted to come over and look into it.

153
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:55,759
Sure.

154
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:57,799
I'll just head inside.

155
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,399
You go in first, go ahead.

156
00:12:58,399 --> 00:12:58,919
Come on in.

157
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,159
Here.

158
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:02,120
Please come in.

159
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:09,840
You live here?

160
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,440
I used to share a room with Liao Bufan.

161
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:16,759
But he snores all the time.

162
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,200
I couldn't sleep well for nights on end.

163
00:13:20,039 --> 00:13:21,879
So I moved in with Wang Yunsheng.

164
00:13:24,679 --> 00:13:25,559
Which bed is yours?

165
00:13:26,159 --> 00:13:26,639
The bottom bunk.

166
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:29,960
The blanket's folded nice and neat.

167
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,080
I got drilled on it a lot.

168
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:34,559
Here.

169
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,320
How is it? The shredded potatoes.

170
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,240
More like potato strips.

171
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:47,840
I put too much soy sauce in that one...

172
00:13:49,759 --> 00:13:50,440
...the cauliflower.

173
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:52,039
You can put soy sauce on that too.

174
00:13:56,879 --> 00:13:59,000
You have to finish all of this soup.

175
00:13:59,360 --> 00:13:59,879
All of it.

176
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,080
Reporting!

177
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,480
Chief Ji, Commissar Tan.

178
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:03,159
Bai Jiani.

179
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:04,960
Chief Ji needs to talk to you about something.

180
00:14:05,759 --> 00:14:06,240
You guys talk.

181
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,360
Is there another room here?

182
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,600
We need to talk in private.

183
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,919
Take Chief Ji to the honors room.

184
00:14:14,559 --> 00:14:14,879
Yes, sir.

185
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:15,679
Okay.

186
00:14:16,919 --> 00:14:17,679
You go ahead and eat.

187
00:14:17,679 --> 00:14:18,840
Come find me when you're done.

188
00:14:34,639 --> 00:14:35,759
Let me do the cooking.

189
00:14:54,799 --> 00:14:55,840
They look really happy.

190
00:14:57,639 --> 00:14:58,759
You know this girl, right?

191
00:14:59,519 --> 00:15:00,159
Yes, I do.

192
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:02,960
How did you meet?

193
00:15:04,759 --> 00:15:06,559
At a Police Open Day.

194
00:15:08,559 --> 00:15:10,240
Do you contact each other often?

195
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,360
We chat on WeChat.

196
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,080
But we don't meet up much.

197
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,200
Have you been in touch recently?

198
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:20,679
Actually, no. Not recently.

199
00:15:21,759 --> 00:15:22,720
Chief Ji, what happened to her?

200
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,879
Is something wrong?

201
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,919
She ran away from home two weeks ago.

202
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,559
Her family hasn't heard from her since.

203
00:15:29,559 --> 00:15:30,960
They were worried, so they called the police.

204
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:36,960
Chief Ji, how did you know

205
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,039
that I knew her?

206
00:15:42,519 --> 00:15:44,039
I have her diary here.

207
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,600
In this diary,

208
00:15:47,639 --> 00:15:48,919
she mentioned you a lot.

209
00:15:58,679 --> 00:15:59,120
Tell you what.

210
00:15:59,519 --> 00:16:00,639
Let's add each other on WeChat.

211
00:16:01,159 --> 00:16:02,759
If she contacts you,

212
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:04,039
or you hear anything about her,

213
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:05,960
let me know.

214
00:16:06,279 --> 00:16:06,559
Okay.

215
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:09,799
Station Chief Ji.

216
00:16:10,679 --> 00:16:11,759
This diary...

217
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:14,039
Can I keep it for now?

218
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:17,759
Congratulations.

219
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,279
You got into the Task Force.

220
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:21,320
One step closer to your Criminal Investigation dream.

221
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,960
Lao Na told me.

222
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,080
Didn't you object to me joining Criminal Investigation?

223
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,440
I still don't want you to work so hard.

224
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:34,399
But what you like matters more.

225
00:16:36,279 --> 00:16:37,240
Once the case is closed,

226
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:39,360
I'll go talk to Old Guo.

227
00:16:39,519 --> 00:16:40,000
We'll see.

228
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,480
I joined the Task Force

229
00:16:42,879 --> 00:16:44,240
not to fulfill a Criminal Investigation dream.

230
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,120
I know.

231
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,519
It's for Mr. Jin's family.

232
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:53,679
All done eating.

233
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,840
The number you have dialed is powered off.

234
00:16:58,960 --> 00:16:59,559
I'm sorry.

235
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,880
Today I sent the video from the last Police Open Day

236
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,079
to Brother Lü Xiao.

237
00:17:31,799 --> 00:17:33,160
I originally just wanted to

238
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,079
ask him more about the SWAT sister.

239
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,599
I didn't expect

240
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,599
to actually run into her on Bar Street.

241
00:17:39,279 --> 00:17:40,079
Even though I still

242
00:17:40,079 --> 00:17:41,480
didn't dare to talk to her first,

243
00:17:41,519 --> 00:17:42,799
she looked at me

244
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,759
and even asked my age,

245
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:44,799
checking my ID card.

246
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:47,920
She had such a SWAT presence.

247
00:17:48,759 --> 00:17:50,119
Finally, I mustered up the courage

248
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,680
to ask if I could add her on WeChat.

249
00:17:52,119 --> 00:17:53,640
I didn't expect her to actually add me.

250
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,519
I'm really so tired.

251
00:17:59,119 --> 00:18:00,640
I really want to leave this house.

252
00:18:01,519 --> 00:18:02,400
If only Sister Bai Jiani

253
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:04,000
could hear me out about this.

254
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:07,119
I'm sure she'd tell me what to do.

255
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,519
Sister Jiani said

256
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,880
Commissar Lu is a ray of light in her life.

257
00:18:14,119 --> 00:18:15,640
She is that ray of light for me too.

258
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,559
I must become

259
00:18:19,119 --> 00:18:20,240
someone just like her.

260
00:18:55,119 --> 00:18:55,440
Have a seat.

261
00:19:19,279 --> 00:19:19,880
A Yuan.

262
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,079
Help me.

263
00:19:25,559 --> 00:19:26,839
I really need money right now.

264
00:19:30,599 --> 00:19:32,440
How much "Spring Snow" I made before,

265
00:19:33,319 --> 00:19:34,200
I know very well.

266
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:36,640
You shouldn't be short on money.

267
00:19:42,839 --> 00:19:43,680
Doing business

268
00:19:45,559 --> 00:19:46,640
always involves risks.

269
00:19:48,759 --> 00:19:50,839
I've lost a lot on investments over the years.

270
00:19:53,759 --> 00:19:54,920
I'm at the end of my rope.

271
00:19:58,440 --> 00:19:59,839
I also wanted to act with integrity

272
00:20:00,759 --> 00:20:02,519
and earn clean money.

273
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:03,839
But now--

274
00:20:03,839 --> 00:20:05,720
But is a single cent of your money clean?

275
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,720
People like us,

276
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,240
with no background

277
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,160
and no capital,

278
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:27,480
who want to make a name for ourselves...

279
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:29,400
What can we rely on?

280
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,519
I wanted to change my identity

281
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,759
and start over with a clean slate,

282
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:43,279
no longer living in fear every day,

283
00:20:44,799 --> 00:20:45,720
or on pins and needles.

284
00:20:55,039 --> 00:20:55,880
I tried.

285
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:57,960
It's just that

286
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:03,480
my luck was a bit bad.

287
00:21:14,119 --> 00:21:16,200
I bought all this new equipment for you.

288
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,359
Try it out and see if it works for you.

289
00:21:23,279 --> 00:21:24,319
If you need anything else,

290
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:32,119
I'll get it for you.

291
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,200
A Yuan.

292
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:41,880
A Yuan.

293
00:21:42,519 --> 00:21:43,000
A Yuan.

294
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:43,880
Listen to me.

295
00:21:46,079 --> 00:21:46,799
I'm begging you.

296
00:21:47,839 --> 00:21:48,799
Help me one last time.

297
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:52,559
If you don't help me,

298
00:21:54,839 --> 00:21:57,519
everything I've worked so hard to build all these years

299
00:21:58,759 --> 00:22:00,160
will be handed over to someone else.

300
00:22:02,119 --> 00:22:03,400
Once I fill this big hole,

301
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:06,599
I'm going to wash my hands of it.

302
00:22:07,799 --> 00:22:09,079
Then you and Naonao

303
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:12,759
can go wherever you want.

304
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,440
No one will stop you, okay?

305
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,640
How many times have I told you?

306
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:19,680
I'm not doing this kind of thing anymore.

307
00:22:30,839 --> 00:22:31,799
How could you do this?

308
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,079
Also,

309
00:22:36,599 --> 00:22:37,559
those two guys from abroad

310
00:22:37,559 --> 00:22:39,400
came to me on their own.

311
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,519
My identity...

312
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,279
other than you,

313
00:22:46,319 --> 00:22:47,440
who else knows?

314
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:52,200
You should know best.

315
00:22:59,319 --> 00:23:00,440
I don't know what you're talking about.

316
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,319
You killed Jester, didn't you?

317
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,720
He had Mr. Bai's phone.

318
00:23:13,519 --> 00:23:14,680
It has the evidence I mentioned.

319
00:23:16,279 --> 00:23:17,200
Believe it or not,

320
00:23:19,039 --> 00:23:19,839
that's your problem.

321
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:31,200
Tell me,

322
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,599
why did you betray me?

323
00:23:39,279 --> 00:23:39,960
Boss,

324
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:47,680
I don't know what Boss Lady

325
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:50,079
told you,

326
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:54,559
but I really...

327
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,960
I really didn't betray you.

328
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,200
Explain it to me.

329
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,640
Why is her photo

330
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,400
on Mr. Bai's phone?

331
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,599
It wasn't me.

332
00:24:31,279 --> 00:24:32,000
Besides me,

333
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:35,079
you're the only one who knows

334
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,799
A Yuan's identity.

335
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,079
And you're the only one

336
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,319
who can contact Mr. Bai.

337
00:24:42,559 --> 00:24:43,559
Who else could it be?

338
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,240
I don't know.

339
00:24:49,839 --> 00:24:50,160
Boss.

340
00:24:50,599 --> 00:24:51,200
Think again.

341
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:52,319
Boss.

342
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,400
I don't know.

343
00:24:59,359 --> 00:25:01,359
I really don't know, Boss.

344
00:25:04,279 --> 00:25:05,920
I really don't know.

345
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:23,640
Calm down.

346
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:31,400
Think carefully.

347
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,000
Did anyone

348
00:25:35,799 --> 00:25:37,079
steal your phone?

349
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:40,000
Or someone close to you...

350
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,640
Could they have leaked it?

351
00:25:53,799 --> 00:25:54,720
Think it over carefully.

352
00:26:01,759 --> 00:26:02,960
Tell me when you've thought it through.

353
00:26:19,799 --> 00:26:20,599
Remember now?

354
00:26:27,319 --> 00:26:27,920
Boss.

355
00:26:42,079 --> 00:26:42,680
Clean it up.

356
00:27:24,839 --> 00:27:25,640
Follow me in. Team fight!

357
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:26,240
Coming, coming, coming!

358
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:26,759
Everyone, keep up!

359
00:27:27,279 --> 00:27:28,640
Support! Support!

360
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:29,559
Support, don't initiate!

361
00:27:29,559 --> 00:27:30,480
Let me borrow your car.

362
00:27:31,839 --> 00:27:32,839
What do you want? It's the weekend!

363
00:27:33,359 --> 00:27:33,880
Going on a date?

364
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,079
Li Jianan ran away from home.

365
00:27:36,119 --> 00:27:36,680
I'm going to look for her.

366
00:27:36,680 --> 00:27:37,319
She's old enough.

367
00:27:37,319 --> 00:27:38,480
Why look for her if she ran away?

368
00:27:53,559 --> 00:27:54,640
Then I have to go with you.

369
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,920
Sir, could you take a look at this?

370
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,839
Do you recognize this girl?

371
00:28:00,559 --> 00:28:01,160
Never seen her.

372
00:28:01,759 --> 00:28:02,960
Take another look. Think about it.

373
00:28:04,279 --> 00:28:05,440
I really don't recognize her.

374
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:06,480
Look, sir.

375
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,400
Please think carefully.

376
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:08,279
She used to come here a lot.

377
00:28:08,599 --> 00:28:10,079
I get a lot of people in here every day.

378
00:28:10,359 --> 00:28:11,359
How could I remember them all?

379
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:11,880
Right?

380
00:28:13,240 --> 00:28:13,799
Fair enough.

381
00:28:13,839 --> 00:28:14,319
Could you...

382
00:28:14,519 --> 00:28:16,839
Then please keep an eye out for us.

383
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:17,480
Will do.

384
00:28:17,559 --> 00:28:17,960
Thank you.

385
00:28:18,079 --> 00:28:18,480
Thank you.

386
00:28:18,799 --> 00:28:19,279
Sir.

387
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:20,799
Have you seen this girl?

388
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:21,680
Never seen her.

389
00:28:22,599 --> 00:28:23,039
Thanks anyway.

390
00:28:23,079 --> 00:28:23,480
No problem.

391
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,200
Hello, sir.

392
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:26,720
Please take a look at this.

393
00:28:26,839 --> 00:28:27,799
Do you recognize this girl?

394
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:29,279
Haven't seen her.

395
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:31,240
Could you look a bit closer?

396
00:28:32,079 --> 00:28:33,039
No, never seen her.

397
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:35,160
Thanks anyway.

398
00:29:01,839 --> 00:29:02,480
How are things on your end?

399
00:29:03,359 --> 00:29:03,839
And yours?

400
00:29:07,599 --> 00:29:08,200
Did you ask around here?

401
00:29:09,799 --> 00:29:10,079
Let's go.

402
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:12,559
Thanks.

403
00:29:16,759 --> 00:29:17,799
Hello, boss.

404
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:19,079
Here's the thing.

405
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:20,359
I wanted to ask,

406
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:22,039
have you seen this girl?

407
00:29:24,119 --> 00:29:24,960
She looks a bit familiar.

408
00:29:25,279 --> 00:29:26,160
I think she's been here.

409
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:30,359
Do you happen to remember

410
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:31,480
when she came by?

411
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,079
How could I remember that?

412
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:36,079
But I don't think it was recently.

413
00:29:38,640 --> 00:29:39,160
Tell you what,

414
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:40,759
if you remember anything,

415
00:29:40,839 --> 00:29:41,839
could you send me a message?

416
00:29:42,079 --> 00:29:42,680
Sure.

417
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:45,119
Isn't that Li Jianan's best friend?

418
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:48,119
Yeah.

419
00:29:53,519 --> 00:29:54,359
Remember me?

420
00:29:55,319 --> 00:29:56,200
Handsome SWAT officer!

421
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:56,960
Sister!

422
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,039
Long time no see!

423
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:59,519
Why are you hanging out by yourself?

424
00:29:59,599 --> 00:30:00,279
Where's Li Jianan?

425
00:30:01,319 --> 00:30:03,640
I haven't seen Jianan for days.

426
00:30:06,759 --> 00:30:08,279
Aren't you two best friends?

427
00:30:08,720 --> 00:30:09,759
What's wrong? Had a fight?

428
00:30:10,759 --> 00:30:11,559
Not really.

429
00:30:12,039 --> 00:30:14,160
This costs money, and she's not into it.

430
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,400
Jianan said...

431
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:17,160
She said she's not like me.

432
00:30:17,759 --> 00:30:18,960
She's a kid with no one to look after her,

433
00:30:19,279 --> 00:30:20,880
so she has to earn her own living.

434
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:22,400
Earn her own living?

435
00:30:23,279 --> 00:30:23,880
How does she do that?

436
00:30:24,519 --> 00:30:26,319
She said she met a nice older sister

437
00:30:26,519 --> 00:30:27,960
who was willing to get her a part-time job.

438
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:30,240
She can make thousands a day!

439
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:33,759
Make thousands a day?

440
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,480
What kind of job is that?

441
00:30:37,039 --> 00:30:40,079
She said it's just chatting and singing with people,

442
00:30:41,079 --> 00:30:42,160
and drinking a little.

443
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:50,960
Do you know where she works part-time?

444
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:51,839
Elite Club.

445
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:53,039
The really famous one.

446
00:30:53,759 --> 00:30:54,920
She also told me

447
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:56,359
she goes by a new name,

448
00:30:56,559 --> 00:30:57,440
called...

449
00:30:57,680 --> 00:30:58,200
Manda.

450
00:31:02,079 --> 00:31:02,680
Manda?

451
00:31:07,279 --> 00:31:07,759
Hello?

452
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:09,880
Hello, Chief Ji.

453
00:31:11,279 --> 00:31:12,920
We've got some leads here

454
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,519
about Li Jianan going missing.

455
00:31:15,039 --> 00:31:16,240
We're over at Bar Street

456
00:31:16,279 --> 00:31:17,559
and ran into a friend of hers.

457
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:20,720
She said Jianan works part-time at Elite Club,

458
00:31:21,839 --> 00:31:22,839
and she took a new name,

459
00:31:22,839 --> 00:31:23,680
called Manda.

460
00:31:24,079 --> 00:31:25,039
Okay, I got it.

461
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:25,920
Thank you both.

462
00:31:26,119 --> 00:31:27,240
I'll arrange for someone to investigate.

463
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:30,759
Chief Ji, can you investigate right now?

464
00:31:31,759 --> 00:31:33,400
Jianan went missing in a place like that.

465
00:31:33,559 --> 00:31:34,559
I'm worried if we're too late,

466
00:31:34,559 --> 00:31:36,240
something bad might happen to her.

467
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:37,599
Don't panic just yet.

468
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:38,839
We can't confirm yet

469
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,799
if her going missing is related to Elite Club.

470
00:31:41,319 --> 00:31:42,279
Investigating recklessly like this

471
00:31:42,960 --> 00:31:44,039
might backfire.

472
00:31:46,240 --> 00:31:46,680
Tell you what,

473
00:31:47,200 --> 00:31:47,920
you go back for now,

474
00:31:48,559 --> 00:31:50,079
and wait for my news, alright?

475
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:52,599
Alright, Chief Ji.

476
00:31:52,599 --> 00:31:53,160
Sorry for the trouble.

477
00:31:55,319 --> 00:31:55,880
What did he say?

478
00:31:58,240 --> 00:31:59,880
Why don't we check out Elite Club first?

479
00:32:01,279 --> 00:32:01,839
Check it out how?

480
00:32:13,079 --> 00:32:13,880
Have you done this before?

481
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:16,359
Where?

482
00:32:17,039 --> 00:32:18,039
Lvteng. Night Scene.

483
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:19,519
That's a big club.

484
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:20,880
Why did you quit?

485
00:32:22,519 --> 00:32:24,039
Luteng is just close to my home.

486
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,880
And I know quite a lot of people there.

487
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:28,319
Who was your manager there?

488
00:32:31,720 --> 00:32:32,240
Sister Dan.

489
00:32:32,599 --> 00:32:33,119
Sister Dan?

490
00:32:36,799 --> 00:32:37,519
Never heard of her.

491
00:32:41,319 --> 00:32:42,480
How did you find this place?

492
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:44,640
Manda recommended me.

493
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:45,480
Manda?

494
00:32:46,519 --> 00:32:47,880
Then you should go find Sister Hong.

495
00:32:50,599 --> 00:32:51,200
All right, all right.

496
00:32:51,559 --> 00:32:52,720
You've got good potential.

497
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:53,960
From now on, you're with me.

498
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:56,279
How's your alcohol tolerance?

499
00:32:56,519 --> 00:32:57,000
Not bad.

500
00:32:58,759 --> 00:33:01,839
Here, as long as you can drink and swallow your pride,

501
00:33:01,839 --> 00:33:02,839
