502
00:33:05,279 --> 00:33:05,680
Okay.

503
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:07,839
Go touch up your makeup first.

504
00:33:08,039 --> 00:33:08,839
Then get ready for work.

505
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,880
That aloof vibe of yours

506
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:14,680
is quite attractive to men.

507
00:33:58,039 --> 00:33:59,000
You know Manda?

508
00:34:00,079 --> 00:34:00,680
Yeah, I do.

509
00:34:00,799 --> 00:34:01,799
Where is she right now?

510
00:34:02,759 --> 00:34:04,200
Isn't she here?

511
00:34:04,400 --> 00:34:05,200
No, she's not.

512
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,920
She barely worked here for a few days.

513
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,800
Borrowed 200 from me on her first day.

514
00:34:09,039 --> 00:34:10,039
Said she'd pay me back when she got paid.

515
00:34:10,239 --> 00:34:11,519
Then disappeared the very next day.

516
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:13,079
Unbelievable.

517
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:15,519
Come on, girls, girls.

518
00:34:16,599 --> 00:34:17,880
Tell her to pay me back later.

519
00:34:18,280 --> 00:34:19,000
Tell her when you see her.

520
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:22,599
Hurry up, hurry up.

521
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:23,480
Let's go, let's go.

522
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:29,840
What's this supposed to mean?

523
00:34:30,199 --> 00:34:31,199
Where's Miaomiao?

524
00:34:32,039 --> 00:34:33,440
I asked for her specifically, and she didn't show?

525
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:34,719
Looks down on me, does she?

526
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:35,199
Boss.

527
00:34:36,039 --> 00:34:37,400
Thinks she's gained followers

528
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,280
and let it go to her head.

529
00:34:38,519 --> 00:34:39,519
Let me tell you,

530
00:34:39,719 --> 00:34:41,519
all her Carnivals and Rockets

531
00:34:41,599 --> 00:34:42,840
were all sent by me.

532
00:34:43,119 --> 00:34:44,679
Brother Hu, we all know that.

533
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,519
She wouldn't dare.

534
00:34:46,840 --> 00:34:48,039
She really went to a training session.

535
00:34:48,039 --> 00:34:48,360
Really.

536
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:50,119
She specially asked me to come over today

537
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:51,599
to have some drinks and chat with you.

538
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:54,039
Why would I drink with you?

539
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:55,800
Come on now.

540
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:56,639
I've got it all set up for you.

541
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:57,599
Hurry, hurry, come on in.

542
00:34:57,599 --> 00:34:58,320
Come in, come in, girls.

543
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,320
Boss.

544
00:34:59,519 --> 00:35:01,000
You're too slow. Brother Hu is getting impatient.

545
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:01,880
Quick, quick, hurry up, quick.

546
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:03,559
Brother Hu, don't be mad.

547
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:04,280
Come on.

548
00:35:04,320 --> 00:35:05,559
Pick a girl and cool off.

549
00:35:05,719 --> 00:35:07,440
Look, there are a few new ones.

550
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:08,320
Which one caught your eye?

551
00:35:09,000 --> 00:35:09,679
Which one do you like?

552
00:35:11,559 --> 00:35:12,480
Come, come. Number eight, number eight.

553
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,199
Come on.

554
00:35:13,199 --> 00:35:14,280
Number forty is good too, her friend.

555
00:35:14,719 --> 00:35:15,280
Definitely good friends.

556
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:15,880
Come, sit here.

557
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:17,920
And that one, number thirty-three.

558
00:35:18,199 --> 00:35:19,000
With the long, flowing hair.

559
00:35:19,559 --> 00:35:20,000
Alright, alright.

560
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:20,559
No, no, no.

561
00:35:20,599 --> 00:35:22,079
Make sure Brother Hu is happy today.

562
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,280
Who can drink the most?

563
00:35:26,599 --> 00:35:27,519
Boss, I can drink.

564
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:28,119
No...

565
00:35:29,199 --> 00:35:30,239
Alright, alright, let's go.

566
00:35:30,679 --> 00:35:31,000
I...

567
00:35:32,639 --> 00:35:32,880
Well...

568
00:35:42,719 --> 00:35:43,920
Come on, come on.

569
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:44,960
Hurry up. Have a seat.

570
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,400
Sit down.

571
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:45,840
Quick, quick!

572
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:50,239
Come on!

573
00:35:50,239 --> 00:35:50,760
Sit down.

574
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:51,840
What's your name?

575
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:56,719
Make sure Brother Hu has a great time today.

576
00:35:57,159 --> 00:35:57,480
